1
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:08,211
Yukako Yamagishi has been
feeling a bit crestfallen lately.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,667
You have a crush on someone?

3
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:14,480
Yeah, and I think they
like me too! Really?

4
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,157
You'll never guess what happened
while I was at Angelo's Rock!

5
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,070
Tell us!

6
00:00:21,153 --> 00:00:23,437
These tourists were taking
pictures and freaking out over it!

7
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,638
Who knew it would be such a hotspot?

8
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,520
Uh, Koichi? You okay?

9
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:37,080
As long as Koichi is in my
heart, that's all I need.

10
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:41,009
At least that's what I used to
think, until the pain set in.

11
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:45,000
If only he'd look at me,
even a glance would suffice.

12
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,840
I have no idea what I'm supposed to do.

13
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:53,210
Cinderella?

14
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,760
This is the best day ever!

15
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:05,788
I can't believe that Hang
Dreamboat actually proposed to me!

16
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:07,660
You're incredible, Dr. Aya!

17
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:09,721
Thank you so much for everything!

18
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,868
Her youth will be spent
as a cheerful troll.

19
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:17,260
Better that than a doleful beauty.

20
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,871
Oh, the things we endure.

21
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:20,650
Come in.

22
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:23,857
As you can see, our makeover
will help you find true love.

23
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:25,705
That's our personal guarantee.

24
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,840
Though the choice is yours.

25
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:41,920
This is Beauty Institute Cinderella.

26
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:44,160
Please don't be shy.

27
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:46,960
My name is Aya Tsuji.

28
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,677
I'm the principal owner and esthetician.

29
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:54,240
And don't worry, I'm not
as apathetic as I sound.

30
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:58,480
I'm actually very
passionate about my work.

31
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,110
Goodness.

32
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:06,620
You have such a lovely face. Gorgeous.

33
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:11,473
To think such a striking beauty was
hiding right here in little old Mariah.

34
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,600
Now then, come in and have a seat.

35
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:18,317
First, I'll need you to fill out
a form with your name and address.

36
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:21,597
Hold on, I haven't decided to go
through with whatever this is.

37
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,974
Of course, here's our list of services.

38
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:26,488
Marry a celebrity makeover?

39
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,353
My institute is a bit of a
departure from the mainstream.

40
00:02:30,540 --> 00:02:34,481
You could describe my work as
constructing visages of good fortune.

41
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,979
One's physiognomy,

42
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:43,177
that is, the form of one's face, is
what essentially dictates one's luck.

43
00:02:43,260 --> 00:02:47,731
Which means a face welcoming of love
increases your chances of finding love.

44
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,560
It's such a pity.

45
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:53,213
Your eyes and eyebrows were
cursed with an unlucky shape.

46
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,717
I'll be straight with you.

47
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,077
This was the shittiest
pitch I've ever heard.

48
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:59,737
You really charge for this crap?

49
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:01,657
With features like these, my dear,

50
00:03:01,740 --> 00:03:05,622
the stronger your affection for a
boy, the harder he'll pull back.

51
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:09,729
Judging by your face, we've
reached the heart of the matter.

52
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,297
You're what's the matter.

53
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:13,177
That has never happened in my life.

54
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:14,090
Oh no?

55
00:03:14,173 --> 00:03:15,617
You'll have to forgive me then.

56
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:17,520
At any rate, let's dive in.

57
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:20,106
Pardon the in-between stages.

58
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,829
I haven't quite mastered
computer graphics.

59
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:26,340
This is a face that will find true love.

60
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:27,580
Hang on a second.

61
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,447
Is this for plastic surgery?

62
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,820
Is that what you do here? No, dear.

63
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,917
I'll achieve this effect with
only makeup and a beauty massage.

64
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,340
But be aware you only have 30 minutes.

65
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:41,417
If you don't find love within that
time, I will refund your thousand yen.

66
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:42,794
Shall we give it a go?

67
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:45,797
Sure, but just the makeup.

68
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:49,760
I suppose I'll humor you this
once, but no funny business.

69
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:52,010
Much obliged.

70
00:03:52,093 --> 00:03:53,294
Let's begin, shall we?

71
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,760
Now, please close your eyes.

72
00:03:57,340 --> 00:04:00,300
Don't spoil the surprise by peeking, okay?

73
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:04,340
And whatever you do, stay perfectly still.

74
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:09,326
If you start wiggling around, my hands
could slip and we don't want that, do we?

75
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,550
Koichi...

76
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:17,840
Will this really help me find true love?

77
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,477
I just don't see how
changing the contours of

78
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:23,148
my eyes and eyebrows
could alter my chances.

79
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,630
Koichi?

80
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:29,617
I've been looking all
over town for you, Yukako.

81
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:30,530
Me?

82
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,590
Yeah.

83
00:04:31,673 --> 00:04:34,020
Earlier, I saw you walking past Rengate.

84
00:04:34,340 --> 00:04:37,137
You looked so down in the dumps
I got a little worried and...

85
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:39,937
Well, I thought I'd make
sure everything was okay.

86
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:40,850
Koichi.

87
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:43,977
Koichi, you really went out of
your way just to check on me?

88
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:45,097
Yeah, of course.

89
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:48,837
I know a lot has happened between us,
but that's all water under the bridge.

90
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:51,560
I sincerely want you to be happy. Really?

91
00:04:51,820 --> 00:04:52,817
Do you mean that?

92
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:53,900
Yeah, I do.

93
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:56,217
I can't believe this is happening.

94
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:57,653
Could it be the makeup?

95
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:00,130
So, uh,

96
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,917
Koichi, instead of just
standing around here,

97
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,077
why don't we find a quiet place to chat?

98
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:05,990
Huh?

99
00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:08,597
If you want, it's your decision.

100
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:13,327
You know, come to think of it, all that
searching has made me a little thirsty.

101
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,460
Huh? Really?

102
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,500
It's actually working.

103
00:05:17,820 --> 00:05:19,585
Things are starting to change.

104
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:23,620
I'm sharing a table with my
adorable yet tenacious Koichi.

105
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,997
Though it's not the manliest choice.

106
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,660
It's incredibly manly.

107
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:30,477
I was thinking about
ordering the same thing.

108
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:34,089
It's like I'm dreaming that
physiognomy stuff works wonders.

109
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,400
I can feel it.

110
00:05:35,660 --> 00:05:38,484
My luck is finally taking
a turn for the better.

111
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:48,280
Is this really happening?

112
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:52,580
I can feel his heartbeat,
the warmth of his body.

113
00:05:53,180 --> 00:05:55,277
This must be what heaven feels like.

114
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,880
I've never been happier in my entire life.

115
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,560
Oh, look at the time.

116
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:00,759
It's already four.

117
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,440
What's going on?

118
00:06:03,620 --> 00:06:06,217
Why does my stomach feel
like it's about to explode?

119
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:08,006
This isn't going to end well.

120
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,057
Sorry, Yukako.

121
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:10,905
I've got to go home right now!

122
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:12,373
Yukoichi, please don't!

123
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,600
It's not fair!

124
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:25,260
Why does it only last
for a measly 30 minutes?!

125
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,440
Damn it, lady!

126
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:31,837
Can't you see it's a red light?

127
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,097
Stuff it up your ass, douche!

128
00:06:33,180 --> 00:06:34,897
It's not my fault the
frickin' light turned red.

129
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:37,686
Why does it only work
for a measly 30 minutes?

130
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:39,857
Do something to make it last longer!

131
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:41,880
You found love, didn't you?

132
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:43,980
Be happy with that for now.

133
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:46,197
You can come back to see me tomorrow.

134
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:49,157
That's what my other customers
do in cases like these.

135
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,070
Never!

136
00:06:50,153 --> 00:06:54,702
A fate that rips me away from Koichi after
30 minutes is a fate I refuse to endure!

137
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:58,320
I want the win-your-soul-mate
treatment! Can you do it?

138
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,837
Graciousness isn't your
strong suit, is it?

139
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,357
Can you do it or not?!

140
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,560
Oh, dear Yukako,

141
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:06,997
Cinderella may have been mistreated,

142
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:10,433
but found true love because
she never lost her pure soul.

143
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:15,037
She's proof that fortune favors those who
keep an open mind and a willing heart.

144
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,037
Do you have the courage to do that?

145
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,200
A willing heart?

146
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:19,480
What does that mean?

147
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:22,172
If you truly wish to transform your luck,

148
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:25,261
it'll take more than mere
physiognomic alteration.

149
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,440
When I was a child,

150
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:30,097
I loved Cinderella's
fairy godmother so much

151
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:32,357
she inspired me to become an esthetician.

152
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:36,675
Like her, I'm dedicating my life to
the service of others by giving joy.

153
00:07:36,900 --> 00:07:41,500
Yukako, you're the apple of my eye, so
I'll help to make your dream come true.

154
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:46,880
However, we'll need to include more
than just your face in the treatment.

155
00:07:55,380 --> 00:07:56,210
Yes,

156
00:07:56,293 --> 00:07:58,177
only a full body treatment will do,

157
00:07:58,260 --> 00:08:00,697
so consider it part of the
Win Your Soulmate package.

158
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:04,477
Use this as an emblem of the
willing heart that beats within you.

159
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:09,177
Apply this lipstick every 30 minutes,
excluding the hours you're asleep, of course.

160
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:11,780
It preserves the potency of the treatment.

161
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,795
Maintain this ritual,

162
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:17,977
and you will have the chance to hold
on to your soulmate for eternity.

163
00:08:18,060 --> 00:08:20,920
It's 72,000 yen for 24 hours.

164
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:23,000
Alright, let's just do it.

165
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,680
Very good.

166
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,657
Stay absolutely still.

167
00:08:29,740 --> 00:08:32,211
Well, and be sure to keep those eyes shut.

168
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,070
Called it.

169
00:08:37,153 --> 00:08:39,668
I knew you weren't some
ordinary beautician.

170
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:45,960
You have powers, and you can see
my Cinderella as well, can't you?

171
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:47,580
Now I get it.

172
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:49,600
You're a stand user like me.

173
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:53,637
But to be honest, I couldn't
care less about that.

174
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:57,377
If you were planning to eliminate me,
you would have done so a long time ago.

175
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:59,060
I trust you.

176
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:01,241
Work your magic, Fairy Godmother.

177
00:09:02,260 --> 00:09:03,840
You startled me there.

178
00:09:05,660 --> 00:09:06,520
That's nice.

179
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,856
Start the treatment.

180
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:10,280
Such a sublime girl.

181
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:11,650
Let's begin.

182
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,762
Know that you're in great hands.

183
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:23,207
Cinderella has the ability to
transform the body's appearance.

184
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:27,285
Its power gives my win-your-soul-mate
treatment that extra kick.

185
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:28,540
Yukako, dear.

186
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:32,506
Bathe in your new beauty as you
have become invincible in love.

187
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,247
This doesn't make any sense.

188
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:39,157
My stomach suddenly feels better.

189
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,070
What the heck?!

190
00:09:40,153 --> 00:09:41,315
This is Yukako's bag!

191
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:44,126
Shoot, I have to hurry
and get it back to her!

192
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:50,020
Hi, Koichi.

193
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:52,920
Ya... Yukako...

194
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:00,900
Oh, yeah.

195
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,660
Before I forget, here.

196
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:05,764
Guess I must have picked
up your bag by mistake.

197
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,297
This one's mine.

198
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:10,960
The whole thing was my fault. I'm sorry.

199
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,060
Well, see you later!

200
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,675
Koichi, please don't run off just yet!

201
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:16,840
Look at me!

202
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:21,080
Really, look at me!

203
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:24,457
Don't I rouse any special
feeling in you? Any at all?

204
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:28,560
Well, you know, I think... maybe.

205
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:32,320
Would you look at that, it's Koichi.

206
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,780
Rohan-sensei!

207
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:37,817
I'm heading over to Kameyu to
do a little bit of research.

208
00:10:37,900 --> 00:10:39,477
Do you want to keep me company?

209
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:42,148
I'd like to, but I
really need to head home.

210
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:45,740
I can't go around snapping
photos at the mall by myself.

211
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,830
What went wrong?

212
00:10:46,913 --> 00:10:47,760
He's leaving!

213
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:51,577
Wasn't I supposed to become
an invincible heroine of love?

214
00:10:51,660 --> 00:10:53,237
What happened to Cinderella's powers?

215
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:55,673
because right now this mission is a dud!

216
00:10:56,140 --> 00:11:00,280
Rest assured, Koichi has already
fallen madly in love with you.

217
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:04,100
But his rational mind is
resisting his heart's impulses.

218
00:11:04,520 --> 00:11:06,217
Did something happen between you two?

219
00:11:06,300 --> 00:11:08,653
That might be the source of the problem.

220
00:11:08,940 --> 00:11:09,770
Oh my!

221
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:11,357
Is this the manga artist?

222
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,657
It's wonderful to meet you.

223
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:14,437
Everything's going to be fine.

224
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:17,344
Soon enough, the tables
will turn in your favor.

225
00:11:17,700 --> 00:11:19,397
Cinderella's power's absolute.

226
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:21,657
And so you know it's currently 4.45.

227
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:24,100
Your 30 minutes have almost expired.

228
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:27,057
It's imperative you remember
to apply the lipstick.

229
00:11:27,140 --> 00:11:27,970
I know.

230
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:29,360
I'm putting it on now.

231
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:33,046
The tables are going to
turn in my favor, huh?

232
00:11:33,640 --> 00:11:34,470
What?

233
00:11:34,553 --> 00:11:35,617
You're going to Kama you?

234
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:37,880
Hey, that's funny, so are we! Huh?

235
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,740
What the hell's going on?

236
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,666
It's like a damn block party.

237
00:11:41,780 --> 00:11:44,537
And to make matters even more
awkward, his mother is here!

238
00:11:44,620 --> 00:11:46,740
The tables will turn in your favor.

239
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:48,340
My ass they will!

240
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:51,409
He'll butcher that
bullshitting beautician!

241
00:11:51,740 --> 00:11:54,328
This seems like an
excellent place to start.

242
00:11:57,900 --> 00:12:00,417
Sunny, you can't use
a flash near the baby.

243
00:12:00,500 --> 00:12:01,980
This isn't good, Josuke.

244
00:12:02,380 --> 00:12:05,597
The stress is triggering her
powers and she's disappearing.

245
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:06,760
Let's go, old man!

246
00:12:06,920 --> 00:12:08,391
We gotta get out of here!

247
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:10,117
Our nest is coming through!

248
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,030
Move it, people!

249
00:12:11,113 --> 00:12:11,943
Out of the way!

250
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:13,280
What's happening?

251
00:12:14,540 --> 00:12:16,220
Sorry about that, Koichi!

252
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:26,979
Wowsers, Yukako...

253
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:29,550
Koichi...

254
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,857
She was right.

255
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:37,180
The tables have turned in my favor.

256
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:44,880
Our willing hearts beat as one, and our
souls are intertwined in a magical dance.

257
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:48,620
Nothing else matters
but us and this moment.

258
00:12:49,100 --> 00:12:50,837
My new life begins now.

259
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:52,260
I can feel it.

260
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:03,220
Hey, Josuke, Okuyasu, don't freak.

261
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:06,140
But Yukako and I kind
of made out. So yeah.

262
00:13:12,780 --> 00:13:14,060
Run that by me again?

263
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,657
What'd she do to you?

264
00:13:15,740 --> 00:13:17,737
Are you going to have to
teach her another lesson?

265
00:13:17,820 --> 00:13:18,960
Whoa, take it easy.

266
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,517
You've got it all wrong.

267
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,953
She didn't do anything.

268
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:25,360
If I'm being honest, I think
I've fallen for Yukako.

269
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:30,537
She's grown on me, and I get excited
thinking about spending time with her.

270
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:32,657
She makes me feel all warm and fuzzy.

271
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:34,997
Could this be love? I'm so confused.

272
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,797
Yo, are you catching all of this, Okuyasu?

273
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:39,497
This gushy stuff would
shock the pants off a stand.

274
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:41,462
Those two playing tongue hockey?

275
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:46,140
Pull it together.

276
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:48,477
It's weird, but it's nothing to cry about.

277
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,860
Anyway, Koichi,

278
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:53,777
I don't have the faintest clue as to what
spawned this stunning change of heart.

279
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:54,690
But hey,

280
00:13:54,773 --> 00:13:58,857
if you and Yukako are really into each
other, then I wish you both the best of luck.

281
00:13:58,940 --> 00:14:00,999
Thanks, but that's not the problem.

282
00:14:01,620 --> 00:14:05,620
I don't know what's going on with
her, but she's refusing to see me.

283
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,280
It's all so baffling.

284
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:10,077
She's been absent from
school for two days.

285
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:12,517
She won't answer the phone
or say a single word.

286
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,640
She's off the grid, but how come?

287
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:17,577
Wow, so she went AWOL
after you guys kissed?

288
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:19,377
And you haven't talked to her since?

289
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:20,290
Not a word.

290
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:21,890
Uh-oh.

291
00:14:21,973 --> 00:14:24,034
The silent treatment's a real bad sign.

292
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,520
It's a shame, too.

293
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:29,898
I admired her crazy devotion, but
ghosting you like this is so uncool.

294
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:31,757
It's gonna be awkward as hell,

295
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:35,317
but I think your best bet is asking
Yukako about it face-to-face.

296
00:14:35,400 --> 00:14:38,576
I'm sorry, bud, but we
shouldn't get involved in this.

297
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:39,710
Yeah.

298
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:43,857
But if things turn ugly, give
us a holler and we'll rush over!

299
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:45,597
We'll be there to help before you know it!

300
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:46,720
Thanks, guys.

301
00:14:47,020 --> 00:14:48,157
I'll see you both later.

302
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,070
See ya.

303
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:52,100
But still, damn that Koichi.

304
00:14:52,300 --> 00:14:53,397
Why does he get to kiss a girl?

305
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,310
Calm down.

306
00:14:54,393 --> 00:14:56,554
You're freaking out over nothing again.

307
00:15:01,380 --> 00:15:03,027
I'd know that hair anywhere.

308
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:04,710
Yukako!

309
00:15:05,900 --> 00:15:07,900
Please, wait up. We need to talk.

310
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:10,610
Yukako?

311
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,030
I'm sorry.

312
00:15:17,113 --> 00:15:18,816
I don't know who you're referring to.

313
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:20,380
Oh, my mistake.

314
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:23,699
I saw your hair and thought
you were someone I know.

315
00:15:32,260 --> 00:15:33,090
No!

316
00:15:33,173 --> 00:15:34,360
I don't want you to go!

317
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:39,380
Oh, Koichi!

318
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:58,017
Why the hell would you do this
to me, you conniving trowel?

319
00:15:58,100 --> 00:16:02,571
My face is falling apart and your stupid
makeup just cracks and flecks away!

320
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,820
Damn you!

321
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,780
You're a backstabbing bitch!

322
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:10,667
Turn my face back to normal!

323
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,840
Foolish girl.

324
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:16,853
Seems you didn't follow my instructions.

325
00:16:17,860 --> 00:16:19,260
It's such a shame.

326
00:16:19,660 --> 00:16:22,377
I truly thought I'd impressed
upon you the importance

327
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:25,537
of applying the Cinderella
lipstick every 30 minutes.

328
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:27,973
So this is my punishment for forgetting?

329
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:30,340
What is this? My hands!

330
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:32,381
What the hell is wrong with them?

331
00:16:33,260 --> 00:16:35,520
The skin on my hands is breaking down!

332
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:38,237
Your palm lines and
fingerprints are disappearing.

333
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,537
That's what happens when
you don't follow orders.

334
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:44,973
That lipstick was an assurance of good
fortune during your quest for love.

335
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:49,077
Tremendous energy is required to
change the course of one's destiny.

336
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,720
And it's all used up.

337
00:16:51,220 --> 00:16:55,220
You've only yourself to blame for
not taking your destiny seriously.

338
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,000
Hey, do you want to die?

339
00:16:57,440 --> 00:16:58,460
Die, you say?

340
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:03,397
Ambition and wealth aren't my only
motivating factors, so save the intimidation.

341
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:06,009
I modeled myself after
the Fairy Godmother.

342
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:09,777
She was a sorceress of the highest
level and bringer of happiness.

343
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:12,180
It really is such a shame.

344
00:17:12,560 --> 00:17:16,357
It's clear to me now that I never should
have tried to make your wish come true.

345
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:18,740
Your face and palms are long gone.

346
00:17:18,980 --> 00:17:21,098
They've been erased from this world.

347
00:17:21,320 --> 00:17:22,900
What did you say?

348
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:24,380
That they're gone.

349
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:27,420
And who has use for
things with missing parts?

350
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:28,600
My face.

351
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,260
It's gone forever.

352
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,840
This isn't fair.

353
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,257
How am I supposed to
live my life like this?

354
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:35,170
Yukako!

355
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:38,340
It's Koichi!

356
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,620
Why is he here?

357
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:42,662
I can't let him learn my secret!

358
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:45,020
No, I'm afraid not.

359
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:47,694
Sorry, but you've got the wrong person.

360
00:17:48,060 --> 00:17:48,890
Dr.

361
00:17:48,973 --> 00:17:51,837
Aya, your beauty institute
is for women only, correct?

362
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:53,508
I want him out of here now.

363
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:58,182
Nice try, but you can't fool me.

364
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:01,437
I'd know that tough as
Nils' temperament anywhere.

365
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:03,520
Now I know for sure you're Yukako.

366
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:07,182
Your personality leaves
a real strong impression.

367
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:11,120
And this lady, she's a
stand user, is that right?

368
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:14,441
From what I'm gathering,
she did something to you.

369
00:18:15,620 --> 00:18:17,000
It's all over.

370
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:18,680
I can't live like this.

371
00:18:19,500 --> 00:18:22,100
You'll pay for this, Aya Tsuji.

372
00:18:22,340 --> 00:18:23,780
I'm gonna murder you!

373
00:18:24,220 --> 00:18:25,780
Don't give in to despair.

374
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:31,060
What the hell?

375
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:34,197
Part of her face flew off and
is flying around the room!

376
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:35,320
There we go.

377
00:18:37,300 --> 00:18:39,080
So this is Koichi.

378
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:44,680
He saw through your altered state
and identified you as Yukako.

379
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:47,980
You tried denying
yourself in front of him,

380
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:51,045
but some people just have
an eye for character.

381
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:52,539
All right, Yukako.

382
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:55,637
Out of consideration for
this young man's efforts,

383
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:58,779
I'll give you one final
chance as a fairy godmother.

384
00:18:59,820 --> 00:19:01,520
Select one of these faces.

385
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:04,500
You have one chance, so choose wisely.

386
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:07,517
Know that your original face is no more.

387
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:10,457
But Cinderella remembers the
face of each patient that

388
00:19:10,540 --> 00:19:13,540
has made use of its ability
and can replicate them.

389
00:19:14,020 --> 00:19:17,000
Now, pick your own face
from among the samples.

390
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:21,497
If you can find it, there's a chance
your original features could be restored.

391
00:19:21,580 --> 00:19:23,521
Your palms and fingerprints, too.

392
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:27,761
Much like Cinderella and
her famous glass slipper,

393
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:30,115
I invite you to find your perfect fit.

394
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:32,697
Why didn't you say that earlier, Dr.

395
00:19:32,780 --> 00:19:33,610
Dumbass?

396
00:19:33,693 --> 00:19:35,318
I'll be out of here in no time flat!

397
00:19:35,460 --> 00:19:38,754
I look in the mirror every
day, so how hard can this be?

398
00:19:39,100 --> 00:19:40,200
Don't get cocky.

399
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,277
If you choose someone else's face,

400
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:45,077
it'll clash with your own
as you might have imagined.

401
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:47,160
Actually, why sugarcoat the truth?

402
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:51,357
As an authority on all things beauty, I
can say your face will become grotesque.

403
00:19:51,440 --> 00:19:53,264
No one will want to look at it.

404
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:57,860
What's more, the contours of your
face will dictate your destiny.

405
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:05,320
Hey, Yukako, be extra careful.

406
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:08,917
Remember, your face is reversed
when you look in a mirror.

407
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,600
Yeah, you're right.

408
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:12,840
Poor girl.

409
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:15,673
Truth is, none of the faces are correct.

410
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,240
Every one is a fake.

411
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:21,109
If you can figure that out,
I'll return your face to normal.

412
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:24,620
That is the fairy
godmother's rule. Damn it.

413
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:28,233
The more I look at them, the
more they look like my face.

414
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:30,120
But this is the one.

415
00:20:30,340 --> 00:20:31,320
It has to be.

416
00:20:31,680 --> 00:20:34,092
No way I'd be able to forget my own face.

417
00:20:34,620 --> 00:20:35,757
You sure about that?

418
00:20:35,840 --> 00:20:38,252
Once you try it on, you'll know for sure.

419
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,837
No, I'm wrong.

420
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:54,417
This isn't the right face.

421
00:20:54,500 --> 00:20:58,357
I almost missed it, but my eyes
have more of a slant than these do.

422
00:20:58,440 --> 00:20:59,560
Which one is it?

423
00:20:59,760 --> 00:21:00,880
I have no idea!

424
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:03,080
What if I make the wrong decision?

425
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,750
What's wrong?

426
00:21:09,960 --> 00:21:12,607
You have a face to
choose, so get to picking.

427
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:14,140
No, I won't.

428
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:16,760
I refuse to choose. But why?

429
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:18,533
So what are you saying?

430
00:21:18,660 --> 00:21:20,997
You want to live out
your life without a face.

431
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:23,280
I'm saying I want Koichi to choose.

432
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:28,057
That way, it'll be a face Koichi can love.

433
00:21:28,140 --> 00:21:30,317
I couldn't care less what it looks like!

434
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:33,177
And the amount of luck it has
doesn't mean a thing to me.

435
00:21:33,260 --> 00:21:34,877
I'll bear with the outcome.

436
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:37,077
And live a life free of regret?

437
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:39,940
But what if I get it
wrong? What will you do?

438
00:21:40,940 --> 00:21:42,220
I'll deal with it.

439
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,457
Please, Koichi!

440
00:21:46,540 --> 00:21:47,760
For me.

441
00:21:58,560 --> 00:21:59,620
Here, this is it.

442
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:01,817
I can't tell you why I chose it.

443
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:03,547
I guess it's just intuition.

444
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:06,642
But if I did mess up and
choose the wrong face...

445
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:11,720
Oh, by the way, this guy's
my stand, Reverb. Right.

446
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:17,120
So anyway, if I screw up, I want you to
wound Reverb's eyes and blind me for life.

447
00:22:18,500 --> 00:22:22,737
I know you said you wouldn't have any
regrets, But knowing you like I do now,

448
00:22:22,820 --> 00:22:24,897
you'd secretly get really
upset if I couldn't

449
00:22:24,980 --> 00:22:27,117
see you just the way you've always been.

450
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:30,217
And though I couldn't see it
before, I'm in love with you.

451
00:22:30,300 --> 00:22:32,359
I couldn't bear to see you unhappy.

452
00:22:32,620 --> 00:22:36,385
That's why the best solution would
be for me to never see again.

453
00:22:41,020 --> 00:22:41,850
Koichi.

454
00:22:42,100 --> 00:22:43,080
Here, Yukako.

455
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:44,510
Right.

456
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:58,790
Look!

457
00:22:58,873 --> 00:23:00,060
It's a perfect fit!

458
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:01,220
That's amazing!

459
00:23:01,920 --> 00:23:02,750
Koichi!

460
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:04,292
Yeah, we did it, Yukako!

461
00:23:04,540 --> 00:23:06,957
It's all because you were
brave enough to choose my face!

462
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:11,687
To think he'd sooner blind himself than
witness his beloved suffer unhappiness.

463
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:15,937
I figured as very godmother, I'd bend
the rules and give them a happy ending.

464
00:23:16,020 --> 00:23:19,549
After all, if I stole the
eyesight of an innocent young man,

465
00:23:19,740 --> 00:23:22,093
what kind of fairy godmother would I be?

466
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:26,980
You Kick dear, young as you are, you
have a keen eye for finding good men.

467
00:23:27,980 --> 00:23:31,020
Beauty Institute Cinderella
is open for business.

468
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:34,280
Our makeovers will help
you find true love.
